      "heading": "The short version"
    },
    {
      "kind": "default",
      "html": "<p>iAuditor solved a real problem: paper forms were poor and digital was better. But picture 7am, a van to unload and a client watching. You open the app, log in, find a template that is not quite right, then fill it in later from memory. The Record says done. It was done in the car park. Then comes the write-up at the desk.</p>",
      "eyebrow": "The actual problem",
      "heading": "The steps are the problem"
    },
    {
      "kind": "default",
